<title>UK: Tarmac interim profit low end of forecasts.</title>
<headline>Tarmac interim profit low end of forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.6 loss	     vs 2.8 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax Pre-except	6.7		    vs 29.1</p>
<p> Pretax Post-except     58.3 loss	    vs 15.9 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.2 billion	  vs 1.15 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share figure reflects the exceptional charges. Some restructuring charges had been forecast by analysts, but underlying pretax profit, before exceptionals, at bottom of forecasts ranging from six to 20 million stg.</p>
</text>
